# Blog posts live here as .md files.
# Frontmatter schema (matches fun-site ../portfolio/posts/):
#   ---
#   title: <string>
#   date: <YYYY-MM-DD>
#   tags: [<string>, ...]
#   series: <string|null>
#   excerpt: <string|auto>
#   draft: <true|false>
#   ---
#
# Committed .md files trigger .github/workflows/blog.yml which runs
# .github/scripts/build-posts.js. Output: posts/<slug>.html, posts.json, feed.xml.
#
# Voice contract: corporate-dry. See ../SKILL.md and the `corporate-speak`
# skill at ~/.config/opencode/skills/corporate-speak/SKILL.md.